# UNDERDELVE: with no catching ladders in mid-air, the lava walk is crossed
# on stepping stones: hop off the ladder onto the first, then jump from the
# edge of each stone to the next. One jump wrong and the lava has you.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 5 5 51 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
hold DOWN 200
expect room_y == 6
expect climbing == 1
hold RIGHT+A 3
wait 40
expect px == 74
expect py == 114
hold RIGHT 3
hold RIGHT+A 3
wait 40
hold RIGHT 12
hold RIGHT+A 3
wait 40
hold RIGHT 12
hold RIGHT+A 3
wait 40
hold RIGHT 12
hold RIGHT+A 3
hold RIGHT 30
expect px > 240
expect py == 130
expect deaths == 0
